sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / ChatGPT
    participant MCP as /mcp server
    participant Q as Worker queue service
    participant J as Jazz

    U->>MCP: open_task_worker_session
    MCP->>Q: openWorkerSession(subject)
    Q->>J: insert 25-minute worker session
    J-->>MCP: session + fixed expiresAt

    loop while session active
      U->>MCP: wait_for_task(waitSeconds=8)
      MCP->>Q: read-only peek
      Q->>J: read queued job
      alt task available
        MCP-->>U: taskId only
        U->>MCP: claim_task(taskId)
        MCP->>Q: atomic bounded claim
        Q->>J: queued -> running
        MCP-->>U: prompt
        U->>U: reason about task
        U->>MCP: save_task_result(result)
        MCP->>Q: idempotent completion
        Q->>J: running -> completed
      else no task
        MCP-->>U: idle + remainingSeconds
      end
    end

    U->>MCP: wait_for_task after deadline
    MCP-->>U: worker session expired
